    skos:definition "Growth factor of the transforming growth factor \\(\\upbeta\\) (TGF-\\(\\upbeta\\)) superfamily, originally identified as a gonadal factor that stimulated secretion of follicle-stimulating hormone, also involved in many aspects of development including mesodermal induction (see mesenchyme), hematopoiesis, and neuronal differentiation."@en ;
